{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836018",
      "title": "Introducing \"Styled Components\" (Third-party Package)",
      "sourceHash": "de9835c06e5b48e5747c7da2f8a95405ae2da9401d84705944b952c8f3cf5317",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 3.96,
          "en": "So now that we had a very detailed look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.96,
          "end": 8.06,
          "en": "at solutions that all built up on vanilla CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.06,
          "end": 10.86,
          "en": "in the end, even CSS modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.86,
          "end": 13.08,
          "en": "in the end, do as you saw,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.08,
          "end": 16.14,
          "en": "we'll now explore a totally different way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.14,
          "end": 18.93,
          "en": "of styling your React components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.93,
          "end": 21.93,
          "en": "And that would be the styled components package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.93,
          "end": 24.693,
          "en": "which you can use in React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.77,
          "end": 29.43,
          "en": "And the idea behind this popular package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.43,
          "end": 34.43,
          "en": "is that you do not define your CSS rules and styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.86,
          "end": 39.86,
          "en": "in separate CSS files, but also not as inline styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 45.51,
          "en": "but instead in special components that are built",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.51,
          "end": 47.403,
          "en": "with help of that package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.48,
          "end": 51.06,
          "en": "And for that, to understand this package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 52.95,
          "en": "we have to install it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.95,
          "end": 57.57,
          "en": "which you can do locally by opening your terminal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.57,
          "end": 61.9,
          "en": "and then running npm install styled-components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 65.7,
          "end": 70.7,
          "en": "or encode sandbox by going to that dependencies area here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 71.31,
          "end": 74.02,
          "en": "and simply adding styled components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 75.45,
          "end": 78.24,
          "en": "like this as a dependency.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 78.24,
          "end": 80.46000000000001,
          "en": "This will install it in this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 82.713,
          "en": "and make it available in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 86.25,
          "en": "Now with it installed locally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 86.25,
          "end": 88.77,
          "en": "you need to restart your development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 88.77,
          "end": 91.083,
          "en": "On CodeSandbox, this is not required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 97.07,
          "en": "And now with that installed, let's say here in AuthInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 97.22999999999999,
          "end": 100.77000000000001,
          "en": "we now wanna style this div here, let's say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 100.77000000000001,
          "end": 103.443,
          "en": "with help of that styled-components package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 107.49000000000001,
          "en": "For this, in AuthInputs.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 107.49000000000001,
          "end": 111.84,
          "en": "you now need to import something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 111.84,
          "end": 116.84,
          "en": "from styled-components and that something is called styled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 121.98,
          "end": 123.54,
          "en": "So you need to import styled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 123.54,
          "end": 128.01,
          "en": "from styled-components and with that imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 128.01,
          "end": 133.01,
          "en": "here in that same file for now, you can then use styled,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 134.22,
          "end": 137.13,
          "en": "which turns out to be a JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 137.13,
          "end": 140.28300000000002,
          "en": "to access different properties with the dot notation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 141.24,
          "end": 143.55,
          "en": "And you'll see that these properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 143.55,
          "end": 148.38,
          "en": "in the end map to HTML elements, for example, the h1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 148.38,
          "end": 153.363,
          "en": "h2 and so on elements and also the div element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 154.41,
          "end": 159.06,
          "en": "And what this will do is it will create a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 159.06,
          "end": 162.6,
          "en": "as a separate component but a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 162.6,
          "end": 165.78300000000002,
          "en": "that will have any styles you want applied to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 167.22,
          "end": 170.64,
          "en": "Now, for that, you now need to use a very strange syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 170.64,
          "end": 173.07,
          "en": "which you maybe haven't seen before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 173.07,
          "end": 176.64,
          "en": "You need to add two back ticks right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 178.95,
          "en": "after this element property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 178.95,
          "end": 181.113,
          "en": "So right after this div here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 182.31,
          "end": 183.24,
          "en": "So again here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 183.24,
          "end": 186.57,
          "en": "these are not single quotes, it's also not a double quote.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 186.57,
          "end": 189.21,
          "en": "Instead, these are two back ticks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 189.21,
          "end": 192.093,
          "en": "a special character you can find on your keyboard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 193.23,
          "end": 194.88,
          "en": "And this code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 194.88,
          "end": 198.45,
          "en": "in the end is a so-called tagged template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 198.45,
          "end": 201.6,
          "en": "which even though you maybe never heard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 201.6,
          "end": 206.6,
          "en": "about it turns out to be a regular JavaScript feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 206.88,
          "end": 208.95,
          "en": "So not React specific",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 208.95,
          "end": 212.31,
          "en": "and not specific to that package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 212.31,
          "end": 215.25,
          "en": "Attached, you find a link to this MDN article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 215.25,
          "end": 218.19,
          "en": "where you can learn more about tagged templates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 218.19,
          "end": 219.45,
          "en": "if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 219.45,
          "end": 223.92000000000002,
          "en": "But in the end, a tagged template is like a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 223.92000000000002,
          "end": 227.04,
          "en": "which receives this template literal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 227.04,
          "end": 229.023,
          "en": "as an input you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 230.52,
          "end": 233.57999999999998,
          "en": "And it's now this template literal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 233.57999999999998,
          "end": 237.03,
          "en": "which should now contain all the styles you wanna apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 237.03,
          "end": 239.04,
          "en": "to this div here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 239.04,
          "end": 241.32,
          "en": "And the great thing, of course, in JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 241.32,
          "end": 245.25,
          "en": "about template literals is that you can write multiline code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 245.25,
          "end": 247.683,
          "en": "like this without breaking the string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 249.6,
          "end": 252.87,
          "en": "So now with that added, we can see that this div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 252.87,
          "end": 256.623,
          "en": "which I wanna replace here, has a class name of controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 257.64,
          "end": 259.11,
          "en": "So therefore, we can go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 259.11,
          "end": 261.72,
          "en": "to the index.css file and there look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 261.72,
          "end": 265.98,
          "en": "for all the styles that should be applied to that div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 265.98,
          "end": 268.77,
          "en": "So to that class here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 268.77,
          "end": 271.35,
          "en": "Of course, I then also have some styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 271.35,
          "end": 273.9,
          "en": "that depend on that class being",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 273.9,
          "end": 278.43,
          "en": "on a parent element, but we'll take care about those later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 278.43,
          "end": 281.01,
          "en": "For now, let's focus on these styles here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 281.01,
          "end": 284.26,
          "en": "which should directly be applied to that div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 285.54,
          "end": 288.31,
          "en": "and we can now copy those styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 289.802,
          "end": 294.383,
          "en": "and paste them into this template literal here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 298.38,
          "end": 302.25,
          "en": "And you don't need to use a camel case notation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 302.25,
          "end": 304.11,
          "en": "or anything like that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 304.11,
          "end": 308.163,
          "en": "Instead, you can write standard CSS code in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 309.36,
          "end": 312.27,
          "en": "And what this overall code will give you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 312.27,
          "end": 316.02,
          "en": "will be a component, a React component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 316.02,
          "end": 319.02,
          "en": "that automatically returns a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 319.02,
          "end": 322.65,
          "en": "that has these styles applied to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 322.65,
          "end": 323.94,
          "en": "And it will be a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 323.94,
          "end": 328.11,
          "en": "that internally also uses the special children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 328.11,
          "end": 331.89,
          "en": "so that it can be wrapped around other content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 331.89,
          "end": 334.38,
          "en": "So with that, we can now store this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 334.38,
          "end": 336.43,
          "en": "in a new constant or variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 337.32,
          "end": 340.56,
          "en": "that here could be named ControlDiv",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 340.56,
          "end": 343.563,
          "en": "or something like this, ControlContainer maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 344.97,
          "end": 346.14,
          "en": "The name is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 346.14,
          "end": 349.32,
          "en": "but it will be such a styled div now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 349.32,
          "end": 352.74,
          "en": "And you can now use this custom component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 352.74,
          "end": 357.74,
          "en": "to replace this div, here the opening tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 357.93,
          "end": 362.93,
          "en": "and then further down below, here the closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 366.84,
          "end": 369.72,
          "en": "Now, with that, I, of course, have a second component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 369.72,
          "end": 372.3,
          "en": "in this AuthInputs component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 372.3,
          "end": 373.8,
          "en": "and we could outsource this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 373.8,
          "end": 376.8,
          "en": "into a separate file if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 376.8,
          "end": 380.19,
          "en": "But for now, since I really only use this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 380.19,
          "end": 384.12,
          "en": "in this file here, I'll keep it in that file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 384.12,
          "end": 388.08,
          "en": "If I were using that in other components as well, storing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 388.08,
          "end": 390.993,
          "en": "in a separate file, of course, would make more sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 391.92,
          "end": 394.023,
          "en": "But with that, we can now save this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 395.25,
          "end": 397.71,
          "en": "And if we now reload, we, of course, see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 397.71,
          "end": 401.73,
          "en": "that we lost some styles here because I did remove",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 401.73,
          "end": 405.603,
          "en": "that controls CSS class that was applied here before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 406.92,
          "end": 409.96,
          "en": "But what we can see if we inspect this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 410.94,
          "end": 413.94,
          "en": "and we take a look at this diff here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 413.94,
          "end": 417.96,
          "en": "is that in there, we got these styles being applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 417.96,
          "end": 422.94,
          "en": "to it, these styles, which we did add here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 424.35,
          "end": 425.85,
          "en": "And by inspecting this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 425.85,
          "end": 428.16,
          "en": "we also see how this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 428.16,
          "end": 429.24,
          "en": "Under the hood,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 429.24,
          "end": 432.66,
          "en": "this styled-components package simply also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 432.66,
          "end": 435.31,
          "en": "creates unique CSS class names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 436.32,
          "end": 439.2,
          "en": "and defines the rules for these classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 439.2,
          "end": 444.2,
          "en": "in the head section where this gets injected here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 446.34,
          "end": 450.48,
          "en": "And then it also adds those created classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 450.48,
          "end": 453.27,
          "en": "to your elements, here to that div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 453.27,
          "end": 457.113,
          "en": "which it created because we used div here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 458.28,
          "end": 462.27,
          "en": "If I would've used p here and I save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 462.27,
          "end": 465.243,
          "en": "this would become a paragraph instead of a div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 466.89,
          "end": 468.36,
          "en": "But here I want a div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 468.36,
          "end": 471.753,
          "en": "But this is how you can work with styled components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 473.04,
          "end": 476.97,
          "en": "But of course, as mentioned, we now lost some styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 476.97,
          "end": 478.56,
          "en": "So let's fix that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 478.56,
          "end": 481.473,
          "en": "and let's learn a bit more about styled components.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}